# Track the extension manifest (declarative source of truth for which
# extensions resolve from npm vs a local path in .pi/settings.json).
# A stale dependency entry here silently shadows the settings local path
# (pi install fetches the npm tarball instead) — keeping it in version
# control makes such drift reviewable instead of silent.
#
# Ignore the lockfile (regenerated by pi install) and node_modules.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
!.gitignore
